{
  "id": "475d66f86b557aa1d5f6f98b",
  "title": "Android Systrace 基础知识 - Input 解读",
  "summary": "本文是 Systrace 系列文章的第六篇，主要是对 Systrace 中的 Input 进行简单介绍，介绍其 Input 的流程； Systrace 中 Input 信息的体现 ，以及如何结合 Input 信息，分析与 Input 相关的问题 本系列的目的是通过 Systrace 这个工具，从另外一个角度来看待 Android 系统整体的运行，同时也从另外一个角度来对 Framework 进行学习。也许你看了很多讲 Framework 的文章，但是总是记不住代码，或者不清楚其运行的流程，也许从 Systrace 这个图形化的角度，你可以理解的更深入一些。",
  "content": "<p>本文是 Systrace 系列文章的第六篇，主要是对 Systrace 中的 Input 进行简单介绍，介绍其 Input 的流程； Systrace 中 Input 信息的体现 ，以及如何结合 Input 信息，分析与 Input 相关的问题</p><p>本系列的目的是通过 Systrace 这个工具，从另外一个角度来看待 Android 系统整体的运行，同时也从另外一个角度来对 Framework 进行学习。也许你看了很多讲 Framework 的文章，但是总是记不住代码，或者不清楚其运行的流程，也许从 Systrace 这个图形化的角度，你可以理解的更深入一些。</p><span></span><blockquote><p><strong>版本说明（2026-10-13 技术复核）：</strong> 保留 2019 年截图和原始 dumpsys 数据，旧实现以 AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code> 为参照，并补充 Android 16 与 Perfetto 观测边界。原图中的队列/埋点不是所有系统固定接口；本次读取了两个公开附件中的 Trace 文本，没有重新运行设备实验。</p></blockquote><h2><a title=\"本文目录\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>本文目录</h2><ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">系列文章目录</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">正文</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Input in Systrace</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputDown 事件在 SystemServer 的工作流</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputDown 事件在 App 的工作流</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">关键知识点和流程</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Input 刷新与 Vsync</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Input 调试信息</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">参考</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">附件</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本文其他地址</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</a></li></ul><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"系列文章目录\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>系列文章目录</h1><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/05/28/Android-Systrace-About/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 简介</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/07/23/Android-Systrace-Pre/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Systrace 预备知识</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/05/27/why-60-fps/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Why 60 fps ？</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/06/29/Android-Systrace-SystemServer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - SystemServer 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2020/02/14/Android-Systrace-SurfaceFlinger/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - SurfaceFlinger 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/11/04/Android-Systrace-Input/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Input 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/Android-Systrace-Vsync/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Vsync 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/10/22/Android-Choreographer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Vsync-App ：基于 Choreographer 的渲染机制详解</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/11/06/Android-Systrace-MainThread-And-RenderThread/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - MainThread 和 RenderThread 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/12/06/Android-Systrace-Binder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Binder 和锁竞争解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/12/15/Android-Systrace-Triple-Buffer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - Triple Buffer 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/12/21/Android-Systrace-CPU/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 基础知识 - CPU Info 解读</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/04/24/android-systrace-smooth-in-action-1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 流畅性实战 1 ：了解卡顿原理</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/04/24/android-systrace-smooth-in-action-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 流畅性实战 2 ：案例分析: MIUI 桌面滑动卡顿分析</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/04/24/android-systrace-smooth-in-action-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 流畅性实战 3 ：卡顿分析过程中的一些疑问</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/09/13/android-systrace-Responsiveness-in-action-1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 响应速度实战 1 ：了解响应速度原理</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/09/13/android-systrace-Responsiveness-in-action-2/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 响应速度实战 2 ：响应速度实战分析-以启动速度为例</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2021/09/13/android-systrace-Responsiveness-in-action-3/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 响应速度实战 3 ：响应速度延伸知识</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2022/01/21/android-systrace-cpu-state-runnable/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 线程 CPU 运行状态分析技巧 - Runnable 篇</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2022/03/13/android-systrace-cpu-state-running/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 线程 CPU 运行状态分析技巧 - Running 篇</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2022/03/13/android-systrace-cpu-state-sleep/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Systrace 线程 CPU 运行状态分析技巧 - Sleep 和 Uninterruptible Sleep 篇</a></li></ol><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"正文\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>正文</h1><p>这篇 Input 文章可与 <a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2025/03/26/Android-Perfetto-05-Chorergrapher/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Perfetto 5：Choreographer 渲染流程</a>、<a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2025/08/02/Android-Perfetto-07-MainThread-And-RenderThread/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Perfetto 7：MainThread 和 RenderThread</a> 一起读。排查时先定位事件进入系统、选择目标、写入 InputChannel、App 接收与处理、完成确认，再关联需要更新的帧和实际呈现。<strong>输入确认完成与画面显示完成是两条不同的边界。</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2019/10/22/Android-Choreographer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Choreographer 篇</a>已经区分了 Looper 消息分发与 native FD 回调。输入通道可读时也会通过 native Looper 进入 Java，因此不能把所有输入都理解成一个普通 Handler Message。本文主要讨论触摸 MotionEvent；按键 KeyEvent 的焦点选择、策略拦截与回退处理另有分支，Home/Back 也不能概括成必定交给当前 App 的普通按键。</p><p>典型触摸路径是：</p><ol><li>触摸控制器按设备策略采样，经驱动形成内核输入事件；硬件采样、报告、InputReader 被调度的频率不必一一相同。</li><li>EventHub 读取事件，InputReader 按设备/mapper 处理坐标、动作等，再通知后续分发链。</li><li>InputDispatcher 根据事件类型、显示、窗口触摸区域、手势状态和策略选择目标连接；不是向所有“注册输入的 App”广播。</li><li>App 接收后按适用路径立即或批量处理。UI 状态变化可能促成下一帧更新，请求会合并，不是每个输入都对应一个新帧。</li></ol><p>时间轴从左到右，但比较的是已对时的事件/区间边界，跨线程的先后关系并不能单独证明因果。仍要对照 channel、序号、调用栈和调度信息。我希望大家在看基于 Systrace 的源码流程分析之后，脑子里有一个图形化的、立体的流程图，你跟的代码走到哪一步了，在图形里也能快速定位。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"Input in Systrace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Input in Systrace</h1><p>以下保留桌面单指滑动案例：通常从 DOWN 开始，经过若干 MOVE，以 UP 或 CANCEL 结束；多指还会有 POINTER_DOWN/POINTER_UP，不能把所有手势都固定为 Down-Move-Up。</p><p><img alt=\"历史桌面滑动概览：InputReader、Dispatcher、连接队列与 App 轨道\"></p><p>原图中的 <code>InputReader</code> 和 <code>InputDispatcher</code> 是 system_server 的 native 线程。其余标记需要分别理解：</p><ol><li>InputReader 处理 EventHub 读入的数据，触摸路径使用 Motion 通知，按键使用 Key 通知。</li><li>InputDispatcher 选择目标并维护分发状态。队列和名称属于该版本实现，厂商及新系统埋点可能不同。</li><li><code>oq:</code> 是某个 Connection 的 outbound 队列计数，连接可能对应窗口或 monitor，一个 App 可以有多个窗口/连接。</li><li><code>wq:</code> 记录已成功发布、仍待 finished 协议处理的条目；不是“只有业务返回 true 才算成功”。</li><li><code>aq:pending</code> 是 ViewRootImpl 待取出的输入队列计数，不等于全部正在处理/等待确认的输入数。</li><li><code>deliverInputEvent</code> 是 App 分发处理的跟踪区间，不是内核唤醒时刻；需要另看 sched_wakeup/sched_switch。</li><li>旧查看器的 <code>Input Response</code> / <code>Rendering Response</code> 是交互分析分组，不是通用硬件触摸到屏幕的直接测量。</li><li>手指抬起后，满足手势/速度条件时可以继续 fling；并非每次 UP 必触发 fling。</li></ol><p>下面先看 DOWN。MOVE 的批处理、历史采样和重采样差异会影响时序，不能当作可忽略的小差异。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h2><a title=\"InputDown 事件在 SystemServer 的工作流\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InputDown 事件在 SystemServer 的工作流</h2><p>原图展示 Reader 工作、Dispatcher 调度以及连接计数变化。颜色和计数提供线索，精确时延要选取对应事件并读时间值：</p><p><img alt=\"system_server 中 DOWN 事件相关的 Reader、Dispatcher 和队列计数\"></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h2><a title=\"InputDown 事件在 App 的工作流\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InputDown 事件在 App 的工作流</h2><p>普通 DOWN 通常不走 MOVE 的批量等待路径，可以在输入通道可读后进入分发；这不取决于“系统有没有 VSync”。主线程忙、可运行但未获 CPU 或其他输入阶段等待时，仍可能延后。</p><p><img alt=\"Launcher 接收 DOWN 后进入 deliverInputEvent 的历史选区\"></p><h3><a title=\"App 的 Pending 队列\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>App 的 Pending 队列</h3><p><img alt=\"aq:pending 的一个历史采样值为 1\"></p><p>原图说明“处理完变 0”过于简化。<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/ViewRootImpl.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 <code>ViewRootImpl.doProcessInputEvents()</code></a>在取出一个 QueuedInputEvent 后，先减小 pending 计数，再调用 <code>deliverInputEvent()</code>。所以计数归零时，该事件可能正在处理、等待异步阶段或尚未回传 finished；主线程阻塞在 native 通道读取之前时，这个 Java 队列也不一定先堆起来。</p><h3><a title=\"主线程处理 Input 事件\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>主线程处理 Input 事件</h3><p>图中可见 native poll → InputEventReceiver → ViewRootImpl 输入阶段 → DecorView/Activity/View 分发。这是该事件的路径，不表示所有类型都经过同一组 stage，也不能从 MethodTrace 插桩时长直接推正常运行成本。</p><p><img alt=\"ViewRootImpl 输入阶段进入 DecorView、Activity 与 View 的调用栈\"></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"关键知识点和流程\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关键知识点和流程</h1><p>正常路径可以概括为：Reader 通知 Dispatcher → 事件进入 inbound/pending → 选择目标并进入各连接 outbound → <strong>发布成功后</strong>进入 wait → App 处理 → 通过同一输入通道返回 finished 序号和 handled 状态 → Dispatcher 处理确认并清理或按策略继续。</p><p>数据和确认主要走 InputChannel socket 协议，不是每个触摸都用 Binder 回调 Java InputManagerService。<code>handled=false</code> 也可以是一次合法处理结果，finished 不等于 UI 已经重绘。异常连接清理也可能让队列减少，因此要结合连接状态读计数。</p><h2><a title=\"InputReader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InputReader</h2><p>以 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/inputflinger/InputReader.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code></a> 为源码参照：EventHub 监听输入设备 FD 及设备变化；每轮读出的 RawEvent 由 mapper 处理。该版本缓冲数组容量为 256，指 RawEvent 容量，<strong>不是 256 个完整手势、采样率或所有版本固定常量</strong>。触摸形成 NotifyMotionArgs/MotionEntry 路径，Key 才是 NotifyKeyArgs/KeyEntry。</p><p>下面的历史图包括 <code>interceptKeyBeforeQueueing</code> 等按键分支，不能当作所有触摸都必经的函数链：</p><p><img alt=\"Gityuan 的历史 InputReader 示意图，包含按键策略分支\"></p><p>下面是 Android 9 的完整 <code>loopOnce()</code> 方法，可以看到阻塞读取和 listener flush 均在 Reader 锁外；它仍属于系统源码，不是独立应用示例：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br><span>58</span><br><span>59</span><br><span>60</span><br><span>61</span><br><span>62</span><br><span>63</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span><span>void</span> <span>InputReader::loopOnce</span><span>()</span> </span>{</span><br><span>    <span>int32_t</span> oldGeneration;</span><br><span>    <span>int32_t</span> timeoutMillis;</span><br><span>    <span>bool</span> inputDevicesChanged = <span>false</span>;</span><br><span>    Vector&lt;InputDeviceInfo&gt; inputDevices;</span><br><span>    { <span>// acquire lock</span></span><br><span>        AutoMutex _l(mLock);</span><br><span></span><br><span>        oldGeneration = mGeneration;</span><br><span>        timeoutMillis = <span>-1</span>;</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>uint32_t</span> changes = mConfigurationChangesToRefresh;</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (changes) {</span><br><span>            mConfigurationChangesToRefresh = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>            timeoutMillis = <span>0</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>refreshConfigurationLocked</span>(changes);</span><br><span>        } <span>else</span> <span>if</span> (mNextTimeout != LLONG_MAX) {</span><br><span>            <span>nsecs_t</span> now = <span>systemTime</span>(SYSTEM_TIME_MONOTONIC);</span><br><span>            timeoutMillis = <span>toMillisecondTimeoutDelay</span>(now, mNextTimeout);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    } <span>// release lock</span></span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>size_t</span> count = mEventHub-&gt;<span>getEvents</span>(timeoutMillis, mEventBuffer, EVENT_BUFFER_SIZE);</span><br><span></span><br><span>    { <span>// acquire lock</span></span><br><span>        AutoMutex _l(mLock);</span><br><span>        mReaderIsAliveCondition.<span>broadcast</span>();</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (count) {</span><br><span>            <span>processEventsLocked</span>(mEventBuffer, count);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (mNextTimeout != LLONG_MAX) {</span><br><span>            <span>nsecs_t</span> now = <span>systemTime</span>(SYSTEM_TIME_MONOTONIC);</span><br><span>            <span>if</span> (now &gt;= mNextTimeout) {</span><br><span><span>#<span>if</span> DEBUG_RAW_EVENTS</span></span><br><span>                <span>ALOGD</span>(<span>&quot;Timeout expired, latency=%0.3fms&quot;</span>, (now - mNextTimeout) * <span>0.000001f</span>);</span><br><span><span>#<span>endif</span></span></span><br><span>                mNextTimeout = LLONG_MAX;</span><br><span>                <span>timeoutExpiredLocked</span>(now);</span><br><span>            }</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (oldGeneration != mGeneration) {</span><br><span>            inputDevicesChanged = <span>true</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>getInputDevicesLocked</span>(inputDevices);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    } <span>// release lock</span></span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>// Send out a message that the describes the changed input devices.</span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (inputDevicesChanged) {</span><br><span>        mPolicy-&gt;<span>notifyInputDevicesChanged</span>(inputDevices);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>// Flush queued events out to the listener.</span></span><br><span>    <span>// This must happen outside of the lock because the listener could potentially call</span></span><br><span>    <span>// back into the InputReader&#x27;s methods, such as getScanCodeState, or become blocked</span></span><br><span>    <span>// on another thread similarly waiting to acquire the InputReader lock thereby</span></span><br><span>    <span>// resulting in a deadlock.  This situation is actually quite plausible because the</span></span><br><span>    <span>// listener is actually the input dispatcher, which calls into the window manager,</span></span><br><span>    <span>// which occasionally calls into the input reader.</span></span><br><span>    mQueuedListener-&gt;<span>flush</span>();</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"InputDispatcher\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InputDispatcher</h2><p>Reader 的 listener 通知可能使 Dispatcher 入队并唤醒，但策略过滤和其他唤醒来源也存在。下图的具体 Runnable 选区显示唤醒来自 TID <code>25669</code>（图中 Reader），不能将此推广到每一次 Dispatcher 唤醒：</p><p><img alt=\"一次 InputDispatcher Runnable 选区记录 wakeup from tid 25669\"></p><p><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/inputflinger/InputDispatcher.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android 9 Dispatcher</a>分别处理 Key 与 Motion。Key 常围绕焦点窗口和按键策略；触摸还要命中测试、维护手势目标、处理 split/cancel 等情况。下面旧图中的 <code>dispatchKeyLocked</code>、<code>findFocusedWindowTargetsLocked</code>、<code>publishKeyEvent</code> 明确是 Key 分支，不能直接替代本文的触摸路径。</p><p><img alt=\"Gityuan 的历史 InputDispatcher Key 分支示意图\"></p><p>下面用<strong>流程伪码</strong>概括队列边界：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>dispatchOnce:</span><br><span>    obtain or continue the pending EventEntry</span><br><span>    select eligible targets for the event type and window/touch state</span><br><span>    enqueue a DispatchEntry for each selected connection</span><br><span>    publish through that connection&#x27;s InputPublisher/InputChannel</span><br><span>    if publication succeeds:</span><br><span>        move the entry from outboundQueue to waitQueue</span><br><span>    otherwise:</span><br><span>        handle backpressure or connection errors</span><br><span></span><br><span>on consumer FINISHED(seq, handled):</span><br><span>    locate that connection&#x27;s matching dispatch entry</span><br><span>    process completion / possible fallback policy</span><br><span>    retire or requeue the entry as required</span><br><span>    continue pending dispatch work</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>deliveryTime</code> 在这版 <code>startDispatchCycleLocked()</code> 尝试发布条目时设置；不是硬件采样时刻，也不能不顾后续等待把最初进入 dispatchOnce 的时间当成所有事件统一的投递时刻。<code>WOULD_BLOCK</code> 等背压/错误需要单独处理，不能先假定已经进入 wait。策略命令还可能通过命令队列在合适的锁边界执行。</p><h2><a title=\"InboundQueue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InboundQueue</h2><p><code>notifyKey</code> 与 <code>notifyMotion</code> 经相应检查后可封装并入队。取出条目成为 <code>mPendingEvent</code> 后，<code>iq</code> 计数可以减少，但该事件仍可能等待目标或继续分发，所以 <code>iq=0</code> 不代表系统输入工作全做完。</p><p><img alt=\"iq 记录 Dispatcher inbound 队列长度，取出不等于处理结束\"></p><h2><a title=\"OutboundQueue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>OutboundQueue</h2><p>这是每个 Connection 待发布的条目队列；同一输入可能按规则有多个目标，也可能被过滤。一个进程有多个窗口，monitor 又有独立用途，不能把 Connection 简化成“一 App 一个队列”。下图选中的是 <strong>StatusBar</strong> 连接，值为 <code>1</code>，不是 Launcher 的所有输入数。</p><p><img alt=\"选中的 StatusBar outbound 连接计数为 1\"></p><h2><a title=\"WaitQueue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>WaitQueue</h2><p>发布成功后，Dispatcher 将条目从 outbound 移入 wait。App 的 <code>finishInputEvent(event, handled)</code> 经 native InputConsumer 发送确认；Dispatcher 按连接和序号处理后再移除相应条目，必要时还涉及回退策略。详见 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-9.0.0_r1/libs/input/InputTransport.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputTransport</a> 和 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/InputEventReceiver.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputEventReceiver</a>。</p><p>wait 长时间增长是调查线索，原因可能是 App 未获调度、处理耗时、MOVE 批量等待、确认传送/处理或连接问题。<strong>长度不等于时长，也不是 ANR 判据。</strong> 下图来自 <code>sample.tencent.mat...</code> 的另一份列表案例，选区 <code>32.276 ms</code>，一个计数值为 <code>8</code>；不能把它当成桌面那份 Trace 或八个事件都尚未进入 App。</p><p><img alt=\"另一列表案例中的 wait 计数 8 与 32.276ms 选区\"></p><h2><a title=\"整体逻辑\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>整体逻辑</h2><p>原图来自 <a href=\"http://gityuan.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Gityuan 博客</a>，包含 KeyboardInputMapper/notifyKey；它是历史阅读线索，不是 Android 16 所有触摸输入的精确调用链。现代源码仍需按自己版本跟踪。</p><p><img alt=\"Gityuan 的历史输入时序图，主体为 KeyboardInputMapper 与 notifyKey\"></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"Input 刷新与 Vsync\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Input 刷新与 Vsync</h1><p>那么，是不是屏幕采样率越高越好？先区分触摸采样率、输入报告/调度频率、显示刷新率和 App 实际帧率。120Hz 的周期约 <code>8.33ms</code>，160Hz 为 <code>6.25ms</code>；原文的 120Hz“8ms”只是粗略近似，且这些不是今天所有设备的固定规格。</p><p><img alt=\"历史图标注约 160Hz 采样与 MOVE 批量期间的 wait 变化\"></p><p>我当时在图中把设备标为 160Hz，但 Reader 工作间隔还受报告批次和调度影响。WaitQueue 短暂积累也不等于 App 永远不消费。批量 MOVE 可在 Choreographer INPUT 阶段按帧时间消费，DOWN/UP 等不能用同一规则概括。</p><p><strong>多个采样点不等于只留最新、其余全丢。</strong> <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/MotionEvent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MotionEvent 的 batching 合同</a>允许一个 ACTION_MOVE 携带多个历史样本；应用可先读 <code>getHistoricalX/Y()</code> 和历史时间，再读当前样本。Android 9 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-9.0.0_r1/libs/input/InputTransport.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>InputConsumer.consumeBatch/consumeSamples()</code></a>会选取合适时间范围的样本、加入 MotionEvent history，并维护对应确认序号链；启用重采样时还会根据帧时间和样本估计位置。</p><p>因此不能从 60Hz 显示推出“120Hz 触摸足够”，也不能从 90Hz 推出“必须 180Hz”。更高采样可能减少部分输入等待或提供更细数据，也可能增加功耗/处理负担；2/3 个样本交替成批本身并不证明 UI 必抖。要结合事件时间、历史点/重采样、实际呈现与端到端延迟做对照，不要求采样率必须恰好为刷新率两倍。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"Input 调试信息\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Input 调试信息</h1><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>adb shell dumpsys input</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个命令输出比较多，我截取了 Device、InputReader 和 InputDispatcher 三段来看。以下保留当时的设备快照。字段和格式以设备版本为准；它不是整段交互的连续记录。<code>unknown</code>、空字段与大整数哨兵应按其含义解释。</p><h2><a title=\"Device 信息\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Device 信息</h2><p>设备路径、Descriptor、vendor/product 和映射文件属于这份快照，<code>event6</code> 不是所有手机固定的触摸节点，也不能仅凭这些示例值判定厂商。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>    3: main_touch</span><br><span>      Classes: 0x00000015</span><br><span>      Path: /dev/input/event6</span><br><span>      Enabled: true</span><br><span>      Descriptor: 4055b8a032ccf50ef66dbe2ff99f3b2474e9eab5</span><br><span>      Location: main_touch/input0</span><br><span>      ControllerNumber: 0</span><br><span>      UniqueId: </span><br><span>      Identifier: bus=0x0000, vendor=0xbeef, product=0xdead, version=0x28bb</span><br><span>      KeyLayoutFile: /system/usr/keylayout/main_touch.kl</span><br><span>      KeyCharacterMapFile: /system/usr/keychars/Generic.kcm</span><br><span>      ConfigurationFile: </span><br><span>      HaveKeyboardLayoutOverlay: false</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"Input Reader 状态\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Input Reader 状态</h2><p>Raw 与 Cooked 坐标分开：例中 raw <code>(660, 1338)</code> 转为 cooked <code>(659.389, 1337.401)</code>，反映映射/校准后的结果。<code>PhysicalWidth</code> 这里明确是 px，不是毫米；<code>unknown range</code> 不等于零范围。External Stylus 的 <code>9223372036854775807</code> 是该旧状态中的无有效截止时间等哨兵，不能当成真实输入时刻。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br><span>58</span><br><span>59</span><br><span>60</span><br><span>61</span><br><span>62</span><br><span>63</span><br><span>64</span><br><span>65</span><br><span>66</span><br><span>67</span><br><span>68</span><br><span>69</span><br><span>70</span><br><span>71</span><br><span>72</span><br><span>73</span><br><span>74</span><br><span>75</span><br><span>76</span><br><span>77</span><br><span>78</span><br><span>79</span><br><span>80</span><br><span>81</span><br><span>82</span><br><span>83</span><br><span>84</span><br><span>85</span><br><span>86</span><br><span>87</span><br><span>88</span><br><span>89</span><br><span>90</span><br><span>91</span><br><span>92</span><br><span>93</span><br><span>94</span><br><span>95</span><br><span>96</span><br><span>97</span><br><span>98</span><br><span>99</span><br><span>100</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>  Device 3: main_touch</span><br><span>    Generation: 24</span><br><span>    IsExternal: false</span><br><span>    HasMic:     false</span><br><span>    Sources: 0x00005103</span><br><span>    KeyboardType: 1</span><br><span>    Motion Ranges:</span><br><span>      X: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=1079.000, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      Y: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=2231.000, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      PRESSURE: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=1.000, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      SIZE: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=1.000, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      TOUCH_MAJOR: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=2479.561, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      TOUCH_MINOR: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=2479.561, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      TOOL_MAJOR: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=2479.561, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>      TOOL_MINOR: source=0x00005002, min=0.000, max=2479.561, flat=0.000, fuzz=0.000, resolution=0.000</span><br><span>    Keyboard Input Mapper:</span><br><span>      Parameters:</span><br><span>        HasAssociatedDisplay: false</span><br><span>        OrientationAware: false</span><br><span>        HandlesKeyRepeat: false</span><br><span>      KeyboardType: 1</span><br><span>      Orientation: 0</span><br><span>      KeyDowns: 0 keys currently down</span><br><span>      MetaState: 0x0</span><br><span>      DownTime: 521271703875000</span><br><span>    Touch Input Mapper (mode - direct):</span><br><span>      Parameters:</span><br><span>        GestureMode: multi-touch</span><br><span>        DeviceType: touchScreen</span><br><span>        AssociatedDisplay: hasAssociatedDisplay=true, isExternal=false, displayId=&#x27;&#x27;</span><br><span>        OrientationAware: true</span><br><span>      Raw Touch Axes:</span><br><span>        X: min=0, max=1080, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>        Y: min=0, max=2232, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>        Pressure: min=0, max=127, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>        TouchMajor: min=0, max=512, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>        TouchMinor: unknown range</span><br><span>        ToolMajor: unknown range</span><br><span>        ToolMinor: unknown range</span><br><span>        Orientation: unknown range</span><br><span>        Distance: unknown range</span><br><span>        TiltX: unknown range</span><br><span>        TiltY: unknown range</span><br><span>        TrackingId: min=0, max=65535, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>        Slot: min=0, max=20, flat=0, fuzz=0, resolution=0</span><br><span>      Calibration:</span><br><span>        touch.size.calibration: geometric</span><br><span>        touch.pressure.calibration: physical</span><br><span>        touch.orientation.calibration: none</span><br><span>        touch.distance.calibration: none</span><br><span>        touch.coverage.calibration: none</span><br><span>      Affine Transformation:</span><br><span>        X scale: 1.000</span><br><span>        X ymix: 0.000</span><br><span>        X offset: 0.000</span><br><span>        Y xmix: 0.000</span><br><span>        Y scale: 1.000</span><br><span>        Y offset: 0.000</span><br><span>      Viewport: displayId=0, orientation=0, logicalFrame=[0, 0, 1080, 2232], physicalFrame=[0, 0, 1080, 2232], deviceSize=[1080, 2232]</span><br><span>      SurfaceWidth: 1080px</span><br><span>      SurfaceHeight: 2232px</span><br><span>      SurfaceLeft: 0</span><br><span>      SurfaceTop: 0</span><br><span>      PhysicalWidth: 1080px</span><br><span>      PhysicalHeight: 2232px</span><br><span>      PhysicalLeft: 0</span><br><span>      PhysicalTop: 0</span><br><span>      SurfaceOrientation: 0</span><br><span>      Translation and Scaling Factors:</span><br><span>        XTranslate: 0.000</span><br><span>        YTranslate: 0.000</span><br><span>        XScale: 0.999</span><br><span>        YScale: 1.000</span><br><span>        XPrecision: 1.001</span><br><span>        YPrecision: 1.000</span><br><span>        GeometricScale: 0.999</span><br><span>        PressureScale: 0.008</span><br><span>        SizeScale: 0.002</span><br><span>        OrientationScale: 0.000</span><br><span>        DistanceScale: 0.000</span><br><span>        HaveTilt: false</span><br><span>        TiltXCenter: 0.000</span><br><span>        TiltXScale: 0.000</span><br><span>        TiltYCenter: 0.000</span><br><span>        TiltYScale: 0.000</span><br><span>      Last Raw Button State: 0x00000000</span><br><span>      Last Raw Touch: pointerCount=1</span><br><span>        [0]: id=0, x=660, y=1338, pressure=44, touchMajor=44, touchMinor=44, toolMajor=0, toolMinor=0, orientation=0, tiltX=0, tiltY=0, distance=0, toolType=1, isHovering=false</span><br><span>      Last Cooked Button State: 0x00000000</span><br><span>      Last Cooked Touch: pointerCount=1</span><br><span>        [0]: id=0, x=659.389, y=1337.401, pressure=0.346, touchMajor=43.970, touchMinor=43.970, toolMajor=43.970, toolMinor=43.970, orientation=0.000, tilt=0.000, distance=0.000, toolType=1, isHovering=false</span><br><span>      Stylus Fusion:</span><br><span>        ExternalStylusConnected: false</span><br><span>        External Stylus ID: -1</span><br><span>        External Stylus Data Timeout: 9223372036854775807</span><br><span>      External Stylus State:</span><br><span>        When: 9223372036854775807</span><br><span>        Pressure: 0.000000</span><br><span>        Button State: 0x00000000</span><br><span>        Tool Type: 0</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2><a title=\"InputDispatcher 状态\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>InputDispatcher 状态</h2><p>重点区分 FocusedApplication 与 FocusedWindow、各显示的触摸目标、窗口列表、monitor 通道与连接。MonitoringChannels 不是每个 Window 的普通输入通道清单；下面也只是摘录。<code>DispatchFrozen</code> 是分发状态，不是后来的 cached-app freezer 状态。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span>Input Dispatcher State:</span><br><span>  DispatchEnabled: 1</span><br><span>  DispatchFrozen: 0</span><br><span>  FocusedApplication: name=&#x27;AppWindowToken{ac6ec28 token=Token{a38a4b ActivityRecord{7230f1a u0 com.meizu.flyme.launcher/.Launcher t13}}}&#x27;, dispatchingTimeout=5000.000ms</span><br><span>  FocusedWindow: name=&#x27;Window{3c007ad u0 com.meizu.flyme.launcher/com.meizu.flyme.launcher.Launcher}&#x27;</span><br><span>  TouchStatesByDisplay:</span><br><span>    0: down=true, split=true, deviceId=3, source=0x00005002</span><br><span>      Windows:</span><br><span>        0: name=&#x27;Window{3c007ad u0 com.meizu.flyme.launcher/com.meizu.flyme.launcher.Launcher}&#x27;, pointerIds=0x80000000, targetFlags=0x105</span><br><span>        1: name=&#x27;Window{8cb8f7 u0 com.android.systemui.ImageWallpaper}&#x27;, pointerIds=0x0, targetFlags=0x4102</span><br><span>  Windows:</span><br><span>    2: name=&#x27;Window{ba2fc6b u0 NavigationBar}&#x27;, displayId=0, paused=false, hasFocus=false, hasWallpaper=false, visible=true, canReceiveKeys=false, flags=0x21840068, type=0x000007e3, layer=0, frame=[0,2136][1080,2232], scale=1.000000, touchableRegion=[0,2136][1080,2232], inputFeatures=0x00000000, ownerPid=26514, ownerUid=10033, dispatchingTimeout=5000.000ms</span><br><span>    3: name=&#x27;Window{72b7776 u0 StatusBar}&#x27;, displayId=0, paused=false, hasFocus=false, hasWallpaper=false, visible=true, canReceiveKeys=false, flags=0x81840048, type=0x000007d0, layer=0, frame=[0,0][1080,84], scale=1.000000, touchableRegion=[0,0][1080,84], inputFeatures=0x00000000, ownerPid=26514, ownerUid=10033, dispatchingTimeout=5000.000ms</span><br><span>    9: name=&#x27;Window{3c007ad u0 com.meizu.flyme.launcher/com.meizu.flyme.launcher.Launcher}&#x27;, displayId=0, paused=false, hasFocus=true, hasWallpaper=true, visible=true, canReceiveKeys=true, flags=0x81910120, type=0x00000001, layer=0, frame=[0,0][1080,2232], scale=1.000000, touchableRegion=[0,0][1080,2232], inputFeatures=0x00000000, ownerPid=27619, ownerUid=10021, dispatchingTimeout=5000.000ms</span><br><span>  MonitoringChannels:</span><br><span>    0: &#x27;WindowManager (server)&#x27;</span><br><span>  RecentQueue: length=10</span><br><span>    MotionEvent(deviceId=3, source=0x00005002, action=MOVE, actionButton=0x00000000, flags=0x00000000, metaState=0x00000000, buttonState=0x00000000, edgeFlags=0x00000000, xPrecision=1.0, yPrecision=1.0, displayId=0, pointers=[0: (524.5, 1306.4)]), policyFlags=0x62000000, age=61.2ms</span><br><span>    MotionEvent(deviceId=3, source=0x00005002, action=MOVE, actionButton=0x00000000, flags=0x00000000, metaState=0x00000000, buttonState=0x00000000, edgeFlags=0x00000000, xPrecision=1.0, yPrecision=1.0, displayId=0, pointers=[0: (543.5, 1309.4)]), policyFlags=0x62000000, age=54.7ms</span><br><span>  PendingEvent: &lt;none&gt;</span><br><span>  InboundQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>  ReplacedKeys: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>  Connections:</span><br><span>    0: channelName=&#x27;WindowManager (server)&#x27;, windowName=&#x27;monitor&#x27;, status=NORMAL, monitor=true, inputPublisherBlocked=false</span><br><span>      OutboundQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>      WaitQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>    5: channelName=&#x27;72b7776 StatusBar (server)&#x27;, windowName=&#x27;Window{72b7776 u0 StatusBar}&#x27;, status=NORMAL, monitor=false, inputPublisherBlocked=false</span><br><span>      OutboundQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>      WaitQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>    6: channelName=&#x27;ba2fc6b NavigationBar (server)&#x27;, windowName=&#x27;Window{ba2fc6b u0 NavigationBar}&#x27;, status=NORMAL, monitor=false, inputPublisherBlocked=false</span><br><span>      OutboundQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>      WaitQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>    12: channelName=&#x27;3c007ad com.meizu.flyme.launcher/com.meizu.flyme.launcher.Launcher (server)&#x27;, windowName=&#x27;Window{3c007ad u0 com.meizu.flyme.launcher/com.meizu.flyme.launcher.Launcher}&#x27;, status=NORMAL, monitor=false, inputPublisherBlocked=false</span><br><span>      OutboundQueue: &lt;empty&gt;</span><br><span>      WaitQueue: length=3</span><br><span>        MotionEvent(deviceId=3, source=0x00005002, action=MOVE, actionButton=0x00000000, flags=0x00000000, metaState=0x00000000, buttonState=0x00000000, edgeFlags=0x00000000, xPrecision=1.0, yPrecision=1.0, displayId=0, pointers=[0: (634.4, 1329.4)]), policyFlags=0x62000000, targetFlags=0x00000105, resolvedAction=2, age=17.4ms, wait=16.8ms</span><br><span>        MotionEvent(deviceId=3, source=0x00005002, action=MOVE, actionButton=0x00000000, flags=0x00000000, metaState=0x00000000, buttonState=0x00000000, edgeFlags=0x00000000, xPrecision=1.0, yPrecision=1.0, displayId=0, pointers=[0: (647.4, 1333.4)]), policyFlags=0x62000000, targetFlags=0x00000105, resolvedAction=2, age=11.1ms, wait=10.4ms</span><br><span>        MotionEvent(deviceId=3, source=0x00005002, action=MOVE, actionButton=0x00000000, flags=0x00000000, metaState=0x00000000, buttonState=0x00000000, edgeFlags=0x00000000, xPrecision=1.0, yPrecision=1.0, displayId=0, pointers=[0: (659.4, 1337.4)]), policyFlags=0x62000000, targetFlags=0x00000105, resolvedAction=2, age=5.2ms, wait=4.6ms</span><br><span>  AppSwitch: not pending</span><br><span>  Configuration:</span><br><span>    KeyRepeatDelay: 50.0ms</span><br><span>    KeyRepeatTimeout: 500.0ms</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这份输出有 3 个 MOVE 等待项，<code>age</code> 为从事件时间到 dump 时刻的差，<code>wait</code> 为从该条目的 deliveryTime 到 dump 时刻的差；都不是画面响应总耗时。<code>5000.000ms</code> 是这里报告的分发超时设置，不是所有设备、所有 ANR 类型的统一规则。<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/topic/performance/anrs/diagnose-and-fix-anrs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">官方输入分发 ANR 说明</a>给出的默认值为 5 秒，也讨论无焦点窗口等场景；判断时需关联超时日志、目标窗口和阻塞原因，不能把 3 个待确认事件直接叫 ANR。</p><h2><a title=\"新版本中怎么继续查\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>新版本中怎么继续查</h2><p><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/inputflinger/dispatcher/InputDispatcher.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AOSP Android 16 的 InputDispatcher</a>已有 Perfetto 输入事件追踪后端，但该标签明确要求 userdebug/eng 构建并开启相应 feature flag。不能承诺普通 user 设备只开一个开关就有 <code>android.input.inputevent</code> 数据。</p><p>支持并采到相关 ATrace 时，<a href=\"https://perfetto.dev/docs/analysis/stdlib-docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Perfetto 的 <code>android.input</code> 模块</a>可进一步拆分发送、接收、处理和 ACK 往返；结构化 <code>android.input.inputevent</code> 则有独立数据来源和字段。两者不能混为一套必定存在的数据。输入到帧的关联还可能缺失或属于推测，ACK 往返不是物理触摸到屏幕的完整时间；缺数据记为不可用，不能当零延迟。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"参考\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>参考</h1><p>本文部分图文参考和拷贝自下面几篇文章，同时下面几篇文章讲解了 Input 流程的细节部分，推荐大家在看完这篇文章后，如果对代码细节感兴趣，可以仔细研读下面这几篇非常棒的文章。</p><ol><li><a href=\"http://gityuan.com/2016/12/11/input-reader/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://gityuan.com/2016/12/11/input-reader/</a></li><li><a href=\"http://gityuan.com/2016/12/10/input-manager/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://gityuan.com/2016/12/10/input-manager/</a></li><li><a href=\"http://gityuan.com/2016/12/17/input-dispatcher/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://gityuan.com/2016/12/17/input-dispatcher/</a></li><li><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/29386642\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/29386642</a></li></ol><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"附件\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>附件</h1><p>附件目录包含 <code>trace_input_blog_launcher_scroll.html.zip</code> 和 <code>trace_input_blog_list_jank.html.zip</code>，分别是桌面滑动与列表卡顿案例；解压后为带旧查看器的 HTML。本次确认两份文件可读取，内部包含 process dump 与 ftrace 数据，且目标进程不同。旧 HTML 查看器在当前浏览器的兼容性没有在本次复核中验证；也可用支持旧 Systrace 数据的工具导入并核对事件。<br><a href=\"https://github.com/Gracker/SystraceForBlog/tree/master/Android_Systrace_Input\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">点此链接下载文章所涉及到的 Systrace 附件</a></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"本文其他地址\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>本文其他地址</h1><p>由于博客留言交流不方便，点赞或者交流，可以移步本文的知乎或者掘金页面<br><a href=\"https://juejin.im/post/5dc1838ef265da4d02626ae0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">掘金 - Systrace 基础知识 - Input 解读</a></p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a></p><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</h1><p>下面是个人的介绍和相关的链接，期望与同行的各位多多交流，三人行，则必有我师!</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">博主个人介绍</a> ：里面有个人的微信和微信群链接。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/BlogMap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本博客内容导航</a> ：个人博客内容的一个导航。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2018/05/07/Android-performance-optimization-skills-and-tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">个人整理和搜集的优秀博客文章 - Android 性能优化必知必会</a> ：欢迎大家自荐和推荐 （微信私聊即可）</li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2023/12/30/the-performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android性能优化知识星球</a>：付费社群已于 2026 年停止运营，不再招收新成员；此处保留历史介绍。</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>一个人可以走的更快 , 一群人可以走的更远</strong></p></blockquote><p><img alt=\"微信扫一扫\"></p>",
